    },
    {
      "id": "card_41",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"file://E:/_Knowledge/ObsidianVault/BOOKS/covers/beyond_good_evil.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Beyond Good and Evil</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\"></span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">stated</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">1. <strong>Morality is not universal</strong> — it is a historical and cultural construct, often serving the interests of the weak</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">2. <strong>The will to power</strong> is the fundamental human motive (not survival, not happiness)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">3. <strong>Nihilism is a stage, not an endpoint</strong> — the Übermensch creates new meaning after the death of God</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">4. <strong>Critical thinking is a weapon against any ideology that claims absolute truth</strong></li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 5894,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_42",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"BOOKS/covers/periyar.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Collected Works of Periyar E.V. Ramasamy</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Anti-caste / Dravidian / Political Philosophy</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <p style=\"font-size:12px; color:#999; font-style:italic;\">…</p>  </div></div>",
      "x": 323,
      "y": 5894,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_43",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11481354-L.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Dune</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Science Fiction</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The Fremen** — a model for how a people can be shaped by and shape their environment</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The Litany Against Fear** — facing what must be faced, a Stoic mantra before it was a trope</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Power and prophecy** — the dangers of following charismatic leaders who believe their own mythology</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 616,
      "y": 5894,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_44",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"file://E:/_Knowledge/ObsidianVault/BOOKS/covers/heart_of_darkness.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Heart of Darkness</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\"></span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">stated</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">1. <strong>Colonialism is a shame</strong> — it degrades both the colonized and the colonizer</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">2. <strong>The horror! The horror!</strong> — Kurtz's last words reflect a recognition of his own capacity for evil</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">3. <strong>Civilization is a veneer</strong> — Conrad suggests savagery lies beneath the surface of all \"civilized\" men</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">4. <strong>Ambiguity is intentional</strong> — the novel resists easy moral judgments, forcing the reader to confront complexity</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 6271,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_45",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10362535-L.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Illusions</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Parable</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The illusion of limits** — \"What one person calls the world, another calls nothing at all\"</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Movement as freedom** — the seagull's joy is in flying, not arriving</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Practice as devotion** — mastery comes from loving the discipline, not just the goal</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 323,
      "y": 6271,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_46",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8749519-L.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Jonathan Livingston Seagull</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Fiction</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The pain of imperfection** — Jonathan is expelled for practicing dives that the flock considers dangerous</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Learning from the masters** — his encounter with the Two Great Rays who show him that flight is limited only by thought</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Perfection as a path** — the continuous refinement of skill and spirit as a lifelong practice</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 616,
      "y": 6271,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_47",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8684447-L.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Lord of the Flies</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Fiction</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The conch as fragile democracy** — the conch shell symbolizes the fading order that the boys try to maintain</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The beast within** — the fear of an imagined monster on the island is really the fear of what they might become</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Ralph vs. Jack** — civilization versus savagery, reason versus blood-lust</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 6648,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_48",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/7561012-L.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">Mastery</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Mastery</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Apprenticeship** — the first phase where you absorb everything without judgment</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The apprenticeship of the environment** — learning is not just about skill but about seeing</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Ego as obstacle** — the master has learned what the beginner has yet to: that they know nothing</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
      "x": 323,
      "y": 6648,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "card_49",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; height:100%; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; padding:6px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8235161-L.jpg\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-radius:6px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display:block; margin:0 auto;\"/></div><div>  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0;    margin-bottom:3px; line-height:1.3;\">On the Road</div>  <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px;\"></div>  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#7ec8e3;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">Beat Literature</span>    <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; background:#1e1e30; color:#aaa;          border-radius:3px; padding:2px 7px;\">To Read</span>    <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#f0c040;\"></span>  </div>  <div style=\"margin-top:7px; font-size:12px; color:#7ec8e3; border-bottom:1px solid #333;        padding-bottom:3px;\">Key Takeaways</div>  <ul style=\"padding-left:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">Spontaneous prose** — form that mirrors the speed of consciousness</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">First thought, best thought** — intuition over deliberation</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; line-height:1.4;\">The road as metaphor** — movement as the only reliable source of truth</li></ul>  <p style=\"font-size:11px; color:#5a9fc2; margin:0;\">👆 tap to flip</p></div></div>",
